#: markers.py:49
msgid "A character is or was in a hostile Corporation or Alliance."
msgstr "Character состоит или состоял во враждебной Corporation или Alliance."

#: markers.py:50
msgid "A character joined many Corporations within the last 365 days."
msgstr "Character вступил во многие Corporation за последние 365 дней."

#: markers.py:51
msgid ""
"A character's own contacts hold a hostile with a positive standing or on the"
" watch list."
msgstr ""
"В собственных контактах Character есть враг с положительным стендингом или в"
" списке наблюдения."

#: markers.py:52
msgid "Mails from or to hostiles."
